name texdirflatten
category Package
revision 55064
shortdesc Collect files related to a LaTeX job in a single directory
longdesc The Perl script parses a LaTeX file recursively, scanning all
longdesc child files, and collects details of any included and other
longdesc data files. These component files, are then all put into a
longdesc single directory (thus "flattening" the document's directory
longdesc tree).
depend texdirflatten.ARCH
containersize 4836
containerchecksum 3cd6cf4d9ff3a1a3daef0bd5a998417696f6645cb54679e99e5424ebbe3926c45acad7b999ee4371392a7ba13fe3f2899438ce66efca7829c7aa1eaef84aa6e5
doccontainersize 11016
doccontainerchecksum 1114dce13ac47c4352e968f42e89582b62b2702bc25ce3a9a4fd766b3bd63607e11eab52d19bc9f809b2b67cd92153c4f591632cfc72dcaf1c0a1b1cfb416b11
docfiles size=6
 texmf-dist/doc/man/man1/texdirflatten.1
 texmf-dist/doc/man/man1/texdirflatten.man1.pdf
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texdirflatten/README details="Readme"
runfiles size=3
 texmf-dist/scripts/texdirflatten/texdirflatten
